},[1035,1036,1037,1039],"li",{},[29,1038,545],{}," is 1 (awaited, so unwrapped)",[1035,1041,1042,1044],{},[29,1043,551],{}," is a Promise (forgot await, so it's the raw Promise object)",[1035,1046,1047,1049],{},[29,1048,556],{}," is 3 (awaited, so unwrapped)",[251,1051,1052,1055,1056,1058,1059,1061],{},[686,1053,1054],{},"The lesson",": Forgetting ",[29,1057,705],{}," is subtle. ",[29,1060,551],{}," is still a Promise, not the value inside. Always await promises. Linters can catch this if configured.",[14,1063,1065],{"id":1064},"key-takeaways","Key Takeaways",[1032,1067,1068,1076,1081,1086],{},[1035,1069,1070,1072,1073,1075],{},[29,1071,46],{},"\u002F",[29,1074,705],{}," is syntactic sugar over Promises — same underlying mechanism.",[1035,1077,1078,1080],{},[29,1079,705],{}," pauses the function, not the event loop — other tasks can run.",[1035,1082,702,1083,1085],{},[29,1084,839],{}," for concurrent independent operations — avoid sequential awaits.",[1035,1087,1088,1089,1092],{},"Wrap in ",[29,1090,1091],{},"try\u002Fcatch"," for error handling — same as synchronous code.",[1094,1095,1096],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sdCPZ, html code.shiki .sdCPZ{--shiki-default:#6A737D;--shiki-github-dark:#6A737D}html pre.shiki code .svdQ7, html code.shiki .svdQ7{--shiki-default:#D73A49;--shiki-github-dark:#F97583}html pre.shiki code .sIsaT, html code.shiki .sIsaT{--shiki-default:#6F42C1;--shiki-github-dark:#B392F0}html pre.shiki code .ssxIu, html code.shiki .ssxIu{--shiki-default:#24292E;--shiki-github-dark:#E1E4E8}html pre.shiki code .sCrzJ, html code.shiki .sCrzJ{--shiki-default:#E36209;--shiki-github-dark:#FFAB70}html pre.shiki code .snvgF, html code.shiki .snvgF{--shiki-default:#005CC5;--shiki-github-dark:#79B8FF}html pre.shiki code .sJ6F3, html code.shiki .sJ6F3{--shiki-default:#032F62;--shiki-github-dark:#9ECBFF}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki